# MQ01Porim "Reise zur Abtei": with the mine wall open (MQ01Tate 35) and the mages dead (MQ01Tate 40 sets MQ01Porim 10),
# Porim offers to ferry the player across the lake to the abbey of Tirin. Stages (TES4 numbers): 10 wall open, 11 Porim at
# PorimAufZurAbteiMarkerRef, 14 "Gehen wir.", 15 Porim at the boat, 16 player and Porim seated (boat ride starts),
# 20 landed, 21 Porim says goodbye, 25 goodbye done, 30 abbey reached.

# MQ01PorimScript at stage 10 gives Porim the FindPlayer package; he finds the player wherever they are and force-greets
# (INFO 0000877A "Na, was hab ich gesagt? ..."). "Gehen wir." (MQ01PorimTopic03) sets stage 14 and Porim heads for the boat.
case porim_finds_player
hear 3600 MQ01PorimRef Na, was hab ich gesagt
ask "Gehen wir."
hear 300 MQ01PorimRef ein Boot
bye
expect GetStageDone MQ01Porim 14
end

# Porim walks to the boat (package MQ01PorimZumBoot; its OnPackageDone sets stage 15). The player follows on foot.
case porim_to_the_boat
walk MQ01BootPlayerStuhl
until 3600 GetStageDone MQ01Porim 15
end

# The player sits in MQ01BootPlayerStuhl; when Porim is in his chair too, two seconds later stage 16 starts the 63 s
# crossing (MQ01BootScript) and Porim tells of the mages (MQ01Boot01 .. 07). Stage 20 on landing gives the player
# control again and sends Porim off to the abbey.
case porim_boat_ride
activate MQ01BootPlayerStuhl
until 900 GetStageDone MQ01Porim 16
hear 900 MQ01PorimRef Diese Hexer
until 4500 GetStageDone MQ01Porim 20
end

# Porim walks to the abbey; his package's OnPackageDone, with the player within 200, sets stage 21 and he force-greets
# ("So, da waeren wir: Die Abtei von Tirin", INFO 001A2507, which sets stage 25). MQ01PorimAbteiScript sets 30 on arrival.
case porim_abbey_reached
walk MQ01PorimRef
hear 3600 MQ01PorimRef Abtei von Tirin
expect GetStageDone MQ01Porim 21
until 300 GetStageDone MQ01Porim 25
until 1800 GetStageDone MQ01Porim 30
end
